    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Charming & unique 3-bed bungalow with detached garage on circa 4 acres with sea frontage in extraordinary setting overlooking Broadhaven Bay & the Atlantic Ocean.\r\n\r\nSet in an outstanding coastal location overlooking the spectacular Broadhaven Bay, this charming three-bedroom bungalow offers an excellent opportunity to acquire a beautifully presented home on circa 4 acres of land, with part of the land enjoying sea frontage to the front.\r\n\r\nPresented in turnkey condition, the accommodation is bright, spacious and thoughtfully laid out, comprising an entrance hallway, comfortable sitting room with open fireplace, kitchen/dining room, shower room and three well-proportioned bedrooms. \r\n\r\nThe property is heated throughout by oil-fired central heating, providing a warm and comfortable home in every season.\r\n\r\nThe breathtaking surroundings are undoubtedly one of the property's greatest features, with uninterrupted panoramic views extending across Broadhaven Bay and the Atlantic Ocean to the surrounding hills and unspoilt countryside. From this truly idyllic setting, the shore is just a short walk away, offering an exceptional lifestyle for those seeking peace, privacy and a strong connection with the coast and countryside.\r\n\r\nLocated along the world-famous Wild Atlantic Way, Glengad is a charming rural community renowned for its dramatic coastal scenery, rich heritage and tranquil atmosphere, while offering an abundance of outdoor pursuits including coastal walks, fishing and access to nearby sandy beaches.\r\n\r\nDespite its wonderfully secluded feel, the property is conveniently located for everyday amenities. \r\n\r\nBarnatra is approximately 9 minutes away, while the vibrant towns of Belmullet and Bangor Erris are less than a 20-minute drive, offering a wide range of shops, schools, cafés, restaurants and essential services.\r\n\r\nKillala, Crossmolina and Ballina are also accessible within approximately an hour's drive.\r\n\r\nCombining a spectacular coastal setting, breathtaking views, generous landholding and a beautifully maintained three-bedroom home, this is a truly special property."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance Hallway 1.48m (4'10\") x 2.5m (8'2\")\r\nBright hall with laminate timber flooring.\r\n\r\nHallway 0.88m (2'11\") x 2.96m (9'9\")\r\nWith laminate timber flooring.\r\n\r\nSitting Room 3.6m (11'10\") x 3.38m (11'1\")\r\nBright room to the front of the house with laminate timber flooring, open fireplace, and a large window overlooking the front garden and Broadhaven Bay.\r\n\r\nKitchen/Dining Room 4.98m (16'4\") x 3.27m (10'9\")\r\nFitted kitchen with lino flooring, tiled splashback, built-in storage unit, and two windows providing natural light and stunning countryside views. A glass-panelled door leads outside to the rear.\r\n\r\nShower Room 3.33m (10'11\") x 1.69m (5'7\")\r\nBright room with a tiled floor, pedestal sink, toilet, electric shower with tiled surround, heated towel rail, and a window providing natural light and ventilation.\r\n\r\nBedroom 1 3.97m (13'0\") x 3.16m (10'4\")\r\nDouble room to the rear of the property with lino flooring and a large window overlooking the mountain and landscape.\r\n\r\nBedroom 2 3.14m (10'4\") x 4.1m (13'5\")\r\nDouble room to the front of the property with laminate timber flooring and a large window overlooking Broadhaven Bay.\r\n\r\nBedroom 3 3.36m (11'0\") x 2.41m (7'11\")\r\nSingle room to the front of the property with laminate timber flooring and a large window overlooking Broadhaven Bay."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Charming 3-bed bungalow on circa 4 acres of land with sea frontage\r\nConvenient detached garage\r\nOil-fired central heating and open fireplace\r\nDriveway extending to rear providing ample parking space\r\nStunning panoramic views over Broadhaven Bay & the Atlantic Ocean \r\nLocated along the world-famous Wild Atlantic Way\r\nApproximately 9 minutes from Barnatra & under 20 minutes to Belmullet & Bangor Erris\r\nKillala, Crossmolina, & Ballina all within a 1 hour drive\r\nEasy access to beautiful beaches, fishing, walking trails, & outdoor amenities\r\nRare opportunity to acquire a dream home in one of North Mayo's most scenic locations"
